    "<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><img alt=\"2013년도(제9기) 고객모니터링단 모집 공고\" src=\"http://www.ksponco.or.kr/jsp/upload_files/sb_editor/20121218044523891.jpg\" width=\"630\" /></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></span></span></span></strong></p><table style=\"WIDTH: 630px; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; HEIGHT: 60px\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bordercolor=\"#3c3c3c\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 10px\" bgcolor=\"#fafabf\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\">우리회사는 국민체육진흥공단의 출자회사로서 올림픽공원, 경정공원과 올림픽스포츠센터를 관리·운영하고 있습니다. 이에 고객 여러분에게 보다 나은 서비스를 제공하고자 2013년에 활동하실 고객모니터링단을 아래와 같이 모집합니다. 평소에 시설을 이용하시면서 느끼셨던 불편사항 등을 찾아 개선시킴으로써 수준 높은 복합문화공간으로 발전해 갈 수 있도록 고객 여러분의 많은 참여를 바랍니다.</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.4\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\"><strong><br /><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 모집인원 </span></span> 12명</strong></span></span></span></span></p><table style=\"WIDTH: 630px; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; HEIGHT: 60px\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" bordercolor=\"#3c3c3c\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">구분</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">일반이용객</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">스포츠센터 회원</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">올림픽공원</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">경정공원</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">올림픽공원</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">분당</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">일산</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">체조경기장</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">수영장</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">인원</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">3명</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">1명</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">2명</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">2명</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">2명</span></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-TOP: #888888 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #888888 1px solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">2명</span></td></tr></tbody></table><br /><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.4\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\"><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 모집대상 </span></span> 대한민국 성인남녀 누구나<br /><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 우대사항 </span></span> </strong> <br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">스포츠센터는 해당 스포츠센터 3개월 이상 이용 회원</span></span></span><br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">올림픽공원, 경정공원 인근 거주자 우대</span></span></span><br /><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 모집기간 </span></span> </strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2012년 12월 17일∼2013년 1월 6일</span></span></span><br /><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 활동기간 </span></span> </strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">11개월(2013년 2월∼12월)</span></span></span><br /><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 활동내용 </span></span> </strong> <br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">방문, 전화, 공연 모니터링</span></span></span><br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">매월 정례회의 참석</span></span></span><br /><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 지원방법 </span></span> </strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">해당 사업장 또는 담당자 이메일로 지원서 제출</span></span></span><br /><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 전형방법 </span></span> </strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1차 서류심사, 2차 면접</span></span></span><br /><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 합격발표 </span></span> </strong>합격자 개별 공지 <br /><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 활동지원 </span></span> </strong> <br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">모니터링 활동비 월 10만원 지급</span></span></span><br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">매월 스포츠센터 무료회원권(1종목) 제공</span></span></span><br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">올림픽공원 내 문화공연 관람 기회 제공</span></span></span><br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">연간 차량 무료출입증 발급(해당 영업장 무료이용)</span></span></span><br /><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e31600\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"> 기타사항 </span></span> </strong> <br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">서류는 반환하지 않습니다.(홈페이지 : <a href=\"http://www.ksponco.or.kr/\">http://www.ksponco.or.kr</a>)</span></span></span><br />  <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">고객모니터링 담당자 : 신영인(<a href=\"mailto:thinktree21@kspo.or.kr\">thinktree21@kspo.or.kr</a> / 02.410.1513)</span></span></span><br /><br /></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.4\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #222222\">2012. 12. 17<br /><br /><img alt=\"한국체육산업개발주식회사\" src=\"http://www.ksponco.or.kr/jsp/upload_files/sb_editor/20121217091145697.jpg\" width=\"194\" height=\"46\" /><br /></span></span></span></span></p>": 1
